{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"mechanics-lesson06","version":1,"title":"解析力学","subtitle":"第6回 · 元の第6回・未定乗数と拘束力","scope":"kaiseki_2026_fall_06.pdf、全13物理ページ。元の第6回・未定乗数と拘束力。既存問題と重複する復習と長い証明の再現は出題しない。","sourceManifest":[{"file":"Kyoto_Univ/[2026後期水２]解析力学（数理）/授業資料/kaiseki_2026_fall_06.pdf","sha256":"32f1ca212ce722e6c3545f3ce289cccb353164b6a5de1252f83fa698599272eb","pageCount":13,"reviewedPages":[4,6,10,11,13],"method":"原資料の抽出テキストと該当ページ画像を確認し、数式・記号・適用条件を照らし合わせた。板書写真は原画像を目視した。"}],"questions":[{"id":"mechanics-l06-q01","version":1,"prompt":"なめらかな関数fを独立な正則拘束Gα=0のもとで停留させる。\\(F=f-\\sum_\\alpha\\lambda_\\alpha G_\\alpha\\)を作った後、どの変数で偏微分して0と置く？","answer":"元の変数すべてと、各未定乗数λα。","criterion":"元の変数と乗数の両方で停留条件を立てると言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"kaiseki_2026_fall_06.pdf","page":4,"imageKey":"32f1ca212ce722e6c3545f3ce289cccb353164b6a5de1252f83fa698599272eb:4"}],"promptHtml":"なめらかな関数fを独立な正則拘束Gα=0のもとで停留させる。<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>α</mi></msub><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>α</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F=f-\\sum_\\alpha\\lambda_\\alpha G_\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span>を作った後、どの変数で偏微分して0と置く？","answerHtml":"元の変数すべてと、各未定乗数λα。","criterionHtml":"元の変数と乗数の両方で停留条件を立てると言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"mechanics-l06-q02","version":1,"prompt":"拘束\\(G_\\alpha(q,t)=0\\)を未定乗数λαで組み込む。講義の符号規約で、拡張ラグランジアンは？","answer":"\\(\\widetilde L=L-\\sum_\\alpha\\lambda_\\alpha G_\\alpha\\)。","criterion":"LからλGの和を引ければ正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"kaiseki_2026_fall_06.pdf","page":11,"imageKey":"32f1ca212ce722e6c3545f3ce289cccb353164b6a5de1252f83fa698599272eb:11"}],"promptHtml":"拘束<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_\\alpha(q,t)=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>を未定乗数λαで組み込む。講義の符号規約で、拡張ラグランジアンは？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">~</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>α</mi></msub><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>α</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\widetilde L=L-\\sum_\\alpha\\lambda_\\alpha G_\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"LからλGの和を引ければ正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"mechanics-l06-q03","version":1,"prompt":"\\(\\widetilde L=L-\\sum_\\alpha\\lambda_\\alpha G_\\alpha\\)を使うとき、qj方向の一般化拘束力は？","answer":"\\(-\\sum_\\alpha\\lambda_\\alpha\\partial G_\\alpha/\\partial q_j\\)。","criterion":"符号を含めた拘束の勾配の式を言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"kaiseki_2026_fall_06.pdf","page":10,"imageKey":"32f1ca212ce722e6c3545f3ce289cccb353164b6a5de1252f83fa698599272eb:10"}],"promptHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">~</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>α</mi></msub><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>α</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\widetilde L=L-\\sum_\\alpha\\lambda_\\alpha G_\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span>を使うとき、qj方向の一般化拘束力は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>α</mi></msub><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\sum_\\alpha\\lambda_\\alpha\\partial G_\\alpha/\\partial q_j</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"符号を含めた拘束の勾配の式を言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"mechanics-l06-q04","version":1,"prompt":"速度に依存しない拘束を含む\\(\\widetilde L=L-\\sum_\\alpha\\lambda_\\alpha G_\\alpha\\)について、λαのオイラー・ラグランジュ方程式は何を与える？","answer":"拘束条件\\(G_\\alpha(q,t)=0\\)。","criterion":"元の拘束条件と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"kaiseki_2026_fall_06.pdf","page":11,"imageKey":"32f1ca212ce722e6c3545f3ce289cccb353164b6a5de1252f83fa698599272eb:11"}],"promptHtml":"速度に依存しない拘束を含む<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">~</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>α</mi></msub><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>α</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\widetilde L=L-\\sum_\\alpha\\lambda_\\alpha G_\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span>について、λαのオイラー・ラグランジュ方程式は何を与える？","answerHtml":"拘束条件<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_\\alpha(q,t)=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"元の拘束条件と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"mechanics-l06-q05","version":1,"prompt":"拘束のためにδqjが独立でない場合、\\(\\int\\sum_j A_j\\delta q_j\\,dt=0\\)から直ちに各Aj=0と置いてよい？","answer":"置けない。独立な変分を選ぶか、未定乗数で拘束を組み込む。","criterion":"変分の独立性が必要と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"kaiseki_2026_fall_06.pdf","page":6,"imageKey":"32f1ca212ce722e6c3545f3ce289cccb353164b6a5de1252f83fa698599272eb:6"}],"promptHtml":"拘束のためにδqjが独立でない場合、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∫</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mi>δ</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int\\sum_j A_j\\delta q_j\\,dt=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>から直ちに各Aj=0と置いてよい？","answerHtml":"置けない。独立な変分を選ぶか、未定乗数で拘束を組み込む。","criterionHtml":"変分の独立性が必要と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"mechanics-l06-q06","version":1,"prompt":"長さℓの単振り子で、質量m、重力加速度g、鉛直下向きからの角度θを用いる。糸が張っているときの張力は？","answer":"\\(m\\ell\\dot\\theta^2+mg\\cos\\theta\\)。","criterion":"向心加速度の項と重力の半径方向の項を足せれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"kaiseki_2026_fall_06.pdf","page":13,"imageKey":"32f1ca212ce722e6c3545f3ce289cccb353164b6a5de1252f83fa698599272eb:13"}],"promptHtml":"長さℓの単振り子で、質量m、重力加速度g、鉛直下向きからの角度θを用いる。糸が張っているときの張力は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m\\ell\\dot\\theta^2+mg\\cos\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"向心加速度の項と重力の半径方向の項を足せれば正解。","explanationHtml":""}],"sourceImages":{"32f1ca212ce722e6c3545f3ce289cccb353164b6a5de1252f83fa698599272eb:4":"./assets/sources/32f1ca212ce722e6c3545f3ce289cccb353164b6a5de1252f83fa698599272eb-4.png","32f1ca212ce722e6c3545f3ce289cccb353164b6a5de1252f83fa698599272eb:11":"./assets/sources/32f1ca212ce722e6c3545f3ce289cccb353164b6a5de1252f83fa698599272eb-11.png","32f1ca212ce722e6c3545f3ce289cccb353164b6a5de1252f83fa698599272eb:10":"./assets/sources/32f1ca212ce722e6c3545f3ce289cccb353164b6a5de1252f83fa698599272eb-10.png","32f1ca212ce722e6c3545f3ce289cccb353164b6a5de1252f83fa698599272eb:6":"./assets/sources/32f1ca212ce722e6c3545f3ce289cccb353164b6a5de1252f83fa698599272eb-6.png","32f1ca212ce722e6c3545f3ce289cccb353164b6a5de1252f83fa698599272eb:13":"./assets/sources/32f1ca212ce722e6c3545f3ce289cccb353164b6a5de1252f83fa698599272eb-13.png"},"renderVersion":1}